# Club & Grub - World 7, stage 2b in co-op: "Squid Grotto" (designer D7). The co-op file of levels/w7_l2b.lvl
# (DESIGN.md A.6 / B.3 / D.10, LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.7.3): the same approach (no gate, A.6) with P2's start and the
# co-op Inkjaw, which a co-op file gets by itself: the Tentacle Lock - on surfacing it crosses two tentacles over its
# armoured head; a strike makes the tentacle on the striker's side flinch (24 ticks Beginner / 16 Expert), and the
# head opens for 33 ticks only while both flinch, struck by the two heroes (one on each flanking island) [G34].
# Traits: the octopus is a leech, the jelly flyer (two rows higher) and the tortoise on the step `lone`.

[meta]
format = 2
id = w7_l2b_coop
name = "Squid Grotto"
kind = coop
coop_of = w7_l2b
coop_base_hash = "c296262304a86ae943c680e5f2f32653d0951631a3e700131b0b82efb8af5725"
